window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After getting the shock of her life and learning the man she dated for three years already has a wife and kids, Kat Ramsey has sworn off serious relationships.<br> <br> Unwilling to ever be entangled in another web of lies, Kat’s new life is all about having a good time.<br> <br> Graham Stephenson’s heart has been raked over the coals. All he wants is some peace after everything he’s been through.<br> <br> Drowning his sorrows at a quiet Rhode Island pub, Graham didn’t intend to meet anyone. But then Kat sits down on the stool beside him.<br> <br> The next thing he knows, they’re heading back to his place for a night of fun.<br> <br> Betrayed and broken, the pair find solace in a physical relationship. But deep down, they’re romantics at heart. And when feelings start getting in the way, they’ll be left having to decide if it’s worth taking that risk once more, or if it’s time to walk away.</p>"; 
